Use io.

Define function is_palindrome taking value as a whole number returning a truth value:
    If value is negative:
        Give back false.
    Let original be value.
    Let reversed start at 0.
    Repeat while value > 0:
        Let digit be value modulo 10.
        Set reversed to reversed * 10 + digit.
        Divide value by 10.
    Give back reversed equals original.
Done.

Say is_palindrome(121).
Say is_palindrome(-121).
Say is_palindrome(10).
Return 0.
